 * `applyRealConfig` directly, read `/opt/mc/server.properties` back off disk
 * and confirmed both values, then destroyed the VM). The path-detection
 * TODO on `applyMinecraft` is resolved for the current image: the host-side
 * bind mount (`/opt/mc` -> `/data`) puts server.properties somewhere
